## History of this licence

Kontexto was published under the MIT licence until 2026-09-21. That grant is
not revoked and cannot be: every commit released before the change stays
available under MIT to everyone who already has it or who checks it out from
the public history. The Functional Source License above governs this version
and every version released after the change.

The change was made for one reason, stated plainly: the code should stay
readable, forkable and runnable by anyone who wants to learn from it or run
their own copy, while a commercial rebranded clone competing with kontexto.de
is not part of that deal. Two years after each release, that restriction
expires on its own.

## Third-party components

These are not covered by the licence above and keep their own:

- `frontend/assets/fonts/` holds Bricolage Grotesque and Figtree under the SIL
  Open Font License 1.1, see `frontend/assets/fonts/OFL.txt`.
- `backend/data/profanity_de_raw.txt` is derived from the LDNOOBW list (CC0).
- The German fastText word vectors that `scripts/prepare-data.sh` downloads are
  published by Facebook Research under CC BY-SA 3.0. They are never committed
  to this repository; the build step fetches them and derives the game data in
  `data/` from them locally.
- `frontend/components/ui/` is vendored shadcn/ui source, MIT.

